{"ID":"20240515131414-rcfrlmj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131414-rcfrlmj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131414-rcfrlmj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140542-mvc6vli\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140542-mvc6vli\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140542-mvc6vli\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:365,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:365\u0026#125;","title":"059","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162340"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140542-mvc6vli","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 910px;","id":"20240515140542-mvc6vli","updated":"20240515162340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/14"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LA"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"40"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/14"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：\n病人自述心臟早搏，視神經凹陷，手足冷，有汗，失眠，心悸，頻尿，早上起來背後第五椎有麻感，睡覺時必須左躺，右躺則心跳快不能眠。服少許安眠藥幫助睡眠。有氣喘病史，偶噴氣管擴張劑。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1. 運動時有汗, \n2. 近來腳較冷, \n3. 壓力大時心動悸,\n4. 每日有大便, \n5. 尿頻, 每飲水則小便多, \n6. 胃口好, \n7. 口渴尚好,  \n8. 不會盜汗, \n9. 不怕風吹 \n10.晚上身無寒熱  \n11.雙手足冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈浮弦數有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：白厚乾\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 水氣凌心"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢，炙甘草五錢，龍骨五錢，牡蠣一兩，烏藥五錢，細辛二錢，茯苓三錢，澤瀉三錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先三帖，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人心火不足，小腸火不能有效氣化水分，造成冷水積聚。水克火，水氣凌心造成心動悸。用桂枝甘草湯強心火。龍骨牡蠣湯使陽固守，治頻尿。烏藥治頻尿，細辛可引心火下行入小腸。用茯苓澤瀉利中下焦之水。有心動悸時不要用白芍，因白芍加強靜脈血回流，加重心臟之負擔。患者體內沒水液停聚時澤瀉用三錢即可，有水液停聚時用五錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}